              "type": "text_block",
              "content": {
                "text": "Dr. Ellison holds a Ph.D. in Electrical Engineering and has 12 years of experience in low-power machine learning for sensing. She led the quantization research that underpins Aerivio’s core IP and will devote 0.30 FTE to this effort as Principal Investigator.",
